## Build and run

On the desktop, from `examples/a1-opengl-cube/`:

```
cmake -S . -B build
cmake --build build
./build/project --speed 0.3 --tilt 40
```

For the web, with the Emscripten SDK activated:

```
emcmake cmake -S . -B build_web
cmake --build build_web
```

`build_web/` then holds `index.html`, `project.js` and `project.wasm`: the same files as `web/`. Show the slide
through a web server, from the root of the repository:

```
python3 -m http.server
```

and open `http://localhost:8000/examples/a1-opengl-cube/slides.html`. Click in the cube, press the right
arrow: the slide changes all the same.

